# API Routes

- Versioned under `/api/v1/`. Endpoints: `POST /api/v1/generate` (ZIP) and `POST /api/v1/preview` (256×256 PNG).
- Set `export const prerender = false` on API routes.
- Accept `multipart/form-data` only; otherwise `415` + `UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE`.
- Same-origin only: require matching `Origin` (SPEC §3.5); no CORS / `Access-Control-Allow-Origin`.
- Validate before Sharp: MIME, ≤10MB, padding 0–50, color fields per SPEC §3.
- Generate success: stream ZIP (`application/zip`), `Content-Disposition: attachment`. Build all buffers first; never finalize a partial ZIP after mid-pipeline failure.
- Preview success: single `image/png` (256×256); no ZIP; same visual options as generate, no `presets`.
- Errors: JSON `{ error, message, details? }` with codes from SPEC.
- Reject non-image / oversize uploads; do not log raw file contents; do not eval SVG.
